{"3248550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pizza Empire", "steam_appid": 3248550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍕 <strong>PIZZA EMPIRE — From Pizzaiolo to Emperor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with dough, tomato sauce, and a lot of ambition. One click. One pizza. One empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're nothing more than an apprentice pizza maker in a kitchen too small. But every pizza sold, every euro reinvested, every upgrade unlocked brings you closer to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you'll control the pizzerias of the entire world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔥 FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱️ Click to make pizzas — simple, satisfying, addictive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Automatic ovens, 🛵 delivery drivers, 🍕 restaurants, 🏭 factories, 🌍 worldwide franchises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍕 Evolving recipes — start with a cheese pizza, end with the ultimate Supreme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ Prestige System — reset everything for a permanent bonus and come back stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Ascension — collect 10 stars to transcend: Ruby bonus, then Diamond, stackable infinitely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Golden Pizza — a secret pizza appears sometimes… click fast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Pizza Box — free Steam items to collect while playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 Real-time statistics: pizzas/second, total clicks, playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Steam Achievements — prove you're a true Emperor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248550/extras/8a73c32c766dd91eba21cd91eb8eb9ae.avif?t=1776925793\" width=1281 height=720 /